  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Hardened the authored trough/hay baseline: actions now yield when the player approaches, reject falling/swimming horses, require visible stationary unattached source props, and navmesh-validate loose-hay positions. Generic hay bales were removed because Rockstar also uses those models in stacks and vehicles. Natural shoreline behavior remains excluded because the available Story Mode script only uses authored event coordinates and provides no safe general bank/depth/current solver. The release build is queued to install after RDR2 exits; the issue remains actionable until that installation completes.\n\nQueued ASI SHA-256: `A32E040DF8BC2A07FB7F9964476C3B249B81B77BAF45DFC93527CD656E7840C0`",
